OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrests after officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have made three more arrests
OL,7,Fafter an officer was shot in Nottingham
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,11,Fwas shot in the foot after he
OL,12,Fapproached a man and a woman at a bus
OL,13,Fstop in Angel Row shortly before 04:50
OL,14,FBST on Sunday. It added the male
OL,15,Fofficer remained in hospital and was
OL,16,Fcontinuing his recovery.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
