OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrests after officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said a 35-year-old man and a
OL,7,F33-year-old woman were arrested on
OL,8,FWednesday on suspicion of possession of
OL,9,Fa firearm with intent to endanger life
OL,10,Fand assisting an offender. Both remain
OL,11,Fin custody.
OL,13,FPolice added a 21-year-old woman was
OL,14,Fdetained in London on Tuesday on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender. She
OL,16,Fhas since been released on conditional
OL,17,Fbail.
